                            <comment id="498293" author="adilger" created="Tue, 21 Jul 2026 19:27:47 +0000">&lt;p&gt;This is hanging the testing consistently with 2.16 clients (with 2.16 and master servers), even though the 2.16.0 clients &lt;b&gt;should&lt;/b&gt; have the correct UDIO alignment support from patches &lt;a href="https://review.whamcloud.com/53997" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/53997&lt;/a&gt; ("&lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-17525" title="Unaligned DIO interop with different page sizes fails" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-17525"&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-17525&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; llite: unaligned DIO interop page alignment"), &lt;a href="https://review.whamcloud.com/56775" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/56775&lt;/a&gt; ("&lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-17525" title="Unaligned DIO interop with different page sizes fails" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-17525"&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-17525&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; llite: soft fail unaligned dio") and &lt;a href="https://review.whamcloud.com/56571" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/56571&lt;/a&gt; ("&lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-18284" title="interop sanity test_119e test_119f: UDIO files differ, bsize 1048575, 2.12 servers crash" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-18284"&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-18284&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; llite: disallow udio exceptions").&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Just skipping the test is not sufficient, even though it would stop the interop test failures, because this will still cause real issues with 2.16+ clients (and any that backported UDIO) hanging when they interact with 2.18+ servers.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
